{
  "_note": "Expected lineage, written by hand from the SQL in testbed/postgres/schema.sql, testbed/sqlserver/schema.sql and testbed/dbt/models. Independent of the product. The product's read-only PostgreSQL login cannot see the dbt analytics schema (known issue K2), so dbt models are recorded under the dbt connection.",
